    "detailed_description": "Rust and Resolve is a 2D platforming game, developed with the intent to cause harm to desktop surfaces, monitors and other miscellaneous computer hardware. <br>Play as a small robot tasked with navigating the tricky environment in an attempt to find a way home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br>- Lots of platforming<br>- Progressively difficult environmental challenges<br>- Simple yet challenging control scheme<br>- Character interactions and story development<br>- Speedrun friendly features such as inbuilt timers and personal leaderboards<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142570/extras/ed6fc4e29f28957ed6a73995e94f972c.poster.avif?t=1721663960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142570/extras/ed6fc4e29f28957ed6a73995e94f972c.webm?t=1721663960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142570/extras/ed6fc4e29f28957ed6a73995e94f972c.mp4?t=1721663960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developer Comment:</h2>&quot;This is my first and only (as of release) Indie game.&quot;<br><br>&quot;My intent with this project is to develop a greater understanding of video game production and development. I look forward to seeing how the community interacts with this game and, of course, hope that you have a great time playing.&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "Rust and Resolve is a 2D platforming game, developed with the intent to cause harm to desktop surfaces, monitors and other miscellaneous computer hardware. <br>Play as a small robot tasked with navigating the tricky environment in an attempt to find a way home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br>- Lots of platforming<br>- Progressively difficult environmental challenges<br>- Simple yet challenging control scheme<br>- Character interactions and story development<br>- Speedrun friendly features such as inbuilt timers and personal leaderboards<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142570/extras/ed6fc4e29f28957ed6a73995e94f972c.poster.avif?t=1721663960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142570/extras/ed6fc4e29f28957ed6a73995e94f972c.webm?t=1721663960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142570/extras/ed6fc4e29f28957ed6a73995e94f972c.mp4?t=1721663960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developer Comment:</h2>&quot;This is my first and only (as of release) Indie game.&quot;<br><br>&quot;My intent with this project is to develop a greater understanding of video game production and development. I look forward to seeing how the community interacts with this game and, of course, hope that you have a great time playing.&quot;",
